  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1802.36 Manager",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1802.36 “Manager” means any individual who is responsible for the control, operation, or maintenance of a building, facility, school, or rental dwelling which is owned by another person.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
